{"id": "guodian-bing.001", "witness": "guodian-bing", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "1", "text": "大上下智（知）又（有）之，其即（次）新（亲）誉之，其既〈即（次）〉○（畏）之，其即（次）○（侮）之。信不足，安", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/丙/简1"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-bing.002", "witness": "guodian-bing", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "2", "text": "又（有）不信。猷（犹）○（乎）其贵言也。成事述（遂）○（功），而百○（姓）曰我自○（然）也。古（故）大", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/丙/简2"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-bing.003", "witness": "guodian-bing", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "3", "text": "道发（废），安有○（仁）义。六新（亲）不和，安有孝○（慈）。邦○（家）○（昏）○安又（有）正臣。", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/丙/简3"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-bing.004", "witness": "guodian-bing", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "4", "text": "执大象，天下往。往而不害，安坪（平）大。乐与饵，○（过）客止。古（故）道□□□，", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/丙/简4"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 36, "end": 39}]}
{"id": "guodian-bing.005", "witness": "guodian-bing", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "5", "text": "淡可（呵）其无味也。视之不足见，圣（听）之不足○（闻），而不可既也。", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/丙/简5"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-bing.006", "witness": "guodian-bing", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "6", "text": "君子居则贵左，○（用）兵则贵右。古（故）曰兵者□□□□□□", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/丙/简6"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 23, "end": 29}]}
{"id": "guodian-bing.007", "witness": "guodian-bing", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "7", "text": "得已而甬（用）之。○○为上，弗○（美）也。○〈美〉之，是乐杀人。夫乐□□□", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/丙/简7"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 34, "end": 37}]}
{"id": "guodian-bing.008", "witness": "guodian-bing", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "8", "text": "以得志于天下。古（故）吉事上左，丧事上右。是以卞（偏）○（将", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/丙/简8"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-bing.009", "witness": "guodian-bing", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "9", "text": "军居左，上○（将）军居右，言以丧豊（礼）居之也。古（故）杀□□，", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/丙/简9"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 29, "end": 31}]}
{"id": "guodian-bing.010", "witness": "guodian-bing", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "10", "text": "则以○（哀）悲位（莅）之；战○（胜）则以丧豊（礼）居之。", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/丙/简10"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-bing.011", "witness": "guodian-bing", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "11", "text": "为之者败之，执之者○（失）之。圣人无为，古（故）无败也；无执，古（故）□□□。", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/丙/简11"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 35, "end": 38}]}
{"id": "guodian-bing.012", "witness": "guodian-bing", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "12", "text": "○（慎）终若○（始），则无败事喜（矣）。人之败也，亘（恒）于其○（且）成也败之。是以□", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/丙/简12"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 42, "end": 43}]}
{"id": "guodian-bing.013", "witness": "guodian-bing", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "13", "text": "人欲不欲，不贵○（难）得之货；学不学，复众之所○（过）。是以能○（辅）○（万）勿（物）", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/丙/简13"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-bing.014", "witness": "guodian-bing", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "14", "text": "之自○（然），而弗敢为。", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/丙/简14"}, "status": "unverified"}
